@HostAddress = http://localhost:5193
@ApiKey = avi2807

### 1. Batch Meter Readings (Default)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/meter-readings/batch
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### 2. Batch Meter Readings (With Query Parameters)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/meter-readings/batch?feederId=1&startDate=2026-11-01&endDate=2026-11-30
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### 3. Active Tariff Slabs
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tariff-updates
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### 4. Active Tariff Slabs (Filter by Feeder)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tariff-updates?feederId=FDR-01
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### 5. Outage & Dispatch Alerts
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/dispatch-alerts
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### 6. Outage & Dispatch Alerts (Filter by Feeder)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/dispatch-alerts?feederId=FDR-03
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}
